			"Message": "style(Cocoon): Use HTML em space entity for text-emoji spacing in README header\n\nReplace literal space/newline between component name and emoji with `&#x2001;` (em space) HTML entity in the README.md header table. Applied to both Cocoon 🦋 and Land 🏞️ entries for consistent typographic spacing.\n\nEnsures reliable rendering of visual separation between text and emoji across different Markdown viewers and prevents unwanted line breaks in constrained table cells.",
